# a machine that listens on IPC only: no web, commands run through the socket (F-NET-02, spec/library/machine.md)
** spec: library/machine.md#channels
** The runner starts the machine with the command below, then runs the client; the client asks the machine
** through the CLI (`eve -loc`, `eve -rem`) and through HTTP, and stops it with `eve --serve stop`.
driver e95_test1 is
  process main is
    print "e95_test1: the machine is tested, not this script";
  return;
end e95_test1;
